          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the silent movement of three bright red and highly luminous PANs (sightings of unidentified flying objects) and disappearance behind the landscape: probable observation of wind-carried sky lanterns.",
